	(text "Design Notes (Task 46 - CAN_ISOLATED_FULL):\n- Pure galvanic isolation between primary GND and secondary GND_ISO.\n- ISO7741: Ch A (INA->OUTA) TXD forward; Ch D (OUTD->IND) RXD reverse.\n- SN65HVD230: RS=10k slope control; ISO 11898-2 split 120R termination via VREF + 4.7nF.\n- NXE1S0303MC: 4.7uH + 10uF/100nF EMI input filter, 10uF/100nF + 3.3k min load on output."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 226.06 0)
